# Plans

When writing, updating, or saving a plan, design doc, or implementation plan:

- **Not yet implemented** — `.cursor/plans/` (create the folder if needed)
- **Done** — move it to `.cursor/plans-done/` (create the folder if needed)
- Use a kebab-case markdown filename, e.g. `.cursor/plans/rebuild-installers.md`
- Do **not** write plans to repo-root `plans/`, `docs/plans/`, or chat-only files meant to persist

When a plan is fully implemented, `git mv` it from `.cursor/plans/` to `.cursor/plans-done/`. Do not leave completed work in `.cursor/plans/`.

If an older plan still lives under `plans/`, put it in `.cursor/plans/` or `.cursor/plans-done/` (whichever matches its status) when you next edit it.
